---@field uri? string Required. URI of the image in Cloud Storage. For example, `gs://bucket/inputs/image.png`. Only PNG and JPEG images are supported.
---@field alpha? number Target image opacity. Valid values are from `1.0` (solid, default) to `0.0` (transparent), exclusive. Set this to a value greater than `0.0`.

