---@field codec? string The codec for this text stream. The default is `webvtt`. Supported text codecs: - `srt` - `ttml` - `cea608` - `cea708` - `webvtt`
---@field displayName? string The name for this particular text stream that will be added to the HLS/DASH manifest. Not supported in MP4 files.
