---@field languages? gcp.transcoder_v1.StringList Optional. A list of languages spoken in the input asset, represented by a BCP 47 language code, such as "en-US" or "sr-Latn". For more information, see https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr35/#Unicode_locale_identifier.

